{"seq":4,"slug":"governance","title":"版本治理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/governance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"version-lifecycle-policy","title":"版本生命周期策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/governance/version-lifecycle-policy","wordCount":1604,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"monitoring-adoption","title":"监控与采纳率追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/governance/monitoring-adoption","wordCount":1604,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"documentation-changelog","title":"文档与变更日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/governance/documentation-changelog","wordCount":1660,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"版本治理\">版本治理</h1><p>本章建立围绕版本生命周期的组织级治理体系。版本生命周期策略定义从 Alpha 到 Sunset 的完整状态机和时间窗口承诺——不同 SLA 等级的 API 对应不同的最短支持周期。监控与采纳率追踪解决&quot;我能不能关掉 v1&quot;的决策依据问题——通过实时遥测掌握每个版本的流量占比、客户端分布和迁移进度。文档与变更日志则是版本治理的对外窗口——changelog 不只是记录，它是开发者信任的基础设施。</p>\n<p>三篇文档的关系：策略定义规则 → 监控提供数据 → 文档完成沟通闭环。版本治理的核心目标是让版本最终能被安全地关闭，而不是永远累加。</p>\n"}